The base paper does not state P_t. Ours is calibrated to its Fig. 3a.
If the overstatement moved with P_t it would be an artefact of that calibration.

    P_t   cos mean  spec mean  gap mean  gap min  gap max
    [W]       [dB]       [dB]      [dB]     [dB]     [dB]
   0.50      57.12      49.99      7.13     1.35    10.41
   0.75      60.29      53.36      6.94     1.34     9.90
   1.00      62.48      55.71      6.77     1.33     9.50
   1.75      66.54      60.16      6.38     1.32     8.69
   2.50      68.99      62.89      6.10     1.30     8.19
